From: pocket-debs <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 14:30:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] mobileshell: translate in the domain of the module
Description:
 The QML of the mobileshell module called i18n() without a domain, which
 translates in the domain of the engine that loads it (plasmashell, the
 lock screen greeter), not in plasma_org.kde.plasma.private.mobileshell
 where these strings are translated; "Show N More" and "Clear All
 Notifications" in the action drawer stayed in English. The calls name
 the domain of the module now.
Author: masterxq <masterxq@users.noreply.github.com>
Forwarded: no
License: GPL-2.0-or-later, GPL-2.0-only OR GPL-3.0-only OR LicenseRef-KDE-Accepted-GPL, LGPL-2.0-or-later (as the patched files)
Last-Update: 2026-11-28
---
diff --git a/components/mobileshell/qml/actiondrawer/private/ContentContainer.qml b/components/mobileshell/qml/actiondrawer/private/ContentContainer.qml
index aef9d156d..c2874bb4a 100644
--- a/components/mobileshell/qml/actiondrawer/private/ContentContainer.qml
+++ b/components/mobileshell/qml/actiondrawer/private/ContentContainer.qml
@@ -148,7 +148,7 @@ Item {
                     font.pointSize: Kirigami.Theme.smallFont.pointSize
 
                     icon.name: "edit-clear-history"
-                    text: i18n("Clear All Notifications")
+                    text: i18nd("plasma_org.kde.plasma.private.mobileshell", "Clear All Notifications")
                     onClicked: notificationDrawer.notificationWidget.clearHistory()
                 }
             }
